    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Epic Boon Feat (Prerequisite: Level 19+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase one ability score of your choice by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Beloved of the Sun.</strong> You have Immunity to Radiant damage.</p><p><strong>Blazing Strike.</strong> When you hit a creature with a weapon attack, its damage can be Radiant or the weapon's normal damage type (your choice).</p><p><strong>Burst of Sunlight.</strong> Once per turn, when you hit a creature with an attack that deals Radiant damage, you can shed Bright Light in a 30-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 30 feet until the start of your next turn. This light is sunlight.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-3NlJD33a8USI42uA\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Change the damage type of a weapon attack to Radiant in the roll dialog.</p></section>",
